{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UmTZXi813O1795423740.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[16:45]</p><p>天文台指，一股東北季候風會在明早（11月24日）影響廣東沿岸，預料本港會轉吹偏北強風，天氣逐步轉涼，有幾陣雨，初時雨勢較為頻密。星期三及星期四早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫在16度左右，新界再低兩三度。市民請留意天氣變化，注意保暖。</p><p><br/>此外，受天文大潮及東北季候風的共同影響，預料本港星期三晚上沿岸水位較正常稍高，部分低窪地區可能出現輕微水浸。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:03:55.527555+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T04:17:14.714553+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T09:57:16.249828+00:00","content_hash":"583e1e992e02b3afa0f5015a8e1c8329271b67c4fe959f70e00a9cbb6f8b81f5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T10:03:55.527555+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}